                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm playing games in alphabetical order and you can watch my review here: https://youtu.be/v4D4pV9x7Pc\n\nPrefer to read?\nDon't buy this game. Just don't.\nIt's a western style duelling simulator, that can either be played in VR with each person having 1 controller, or without VR by having players share a keyboard.\nThere are no scoring mechanics, no reaction speed timers, no alternative game modes... nothing. After one round the game has nothing more to offer. Add on top of this a grating announcer voice that plays every round and you have an experience you'll be quitting after 5 minutes.\nTo be perfectly honest, I don't think I'd recommend this game even if it were free, it's just that unenjoyable.",
